<concept base="Anywhere" otherprops="legalnotice_europe-general_egall_8_2023_20230101" id="t00814">
	<title>Brake discs, pads and calipers</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>brake discs, pads, and calipers</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>Check the pads for excessive wear, discs for run out and wear, and calipers for fluid leakage.</p>
		<p>It is recommended to inspect the brake discs and pads every 30,000 km (20,000 miles).</p>
		<p>For more information on checking the pads or lining wear limit, we recommend to refer to the Kia Website.</p>
		<p>(www.Kia-hotline.com)</p>
	</conbody>
